  "derivative_description": "This study uses derived flow features. Dataset-specific preprocessing excludes source and destination IP addresses, ports, timestamps, raw packet payloads, and other record identifiers from model inputs. W&B receives only aggregate class/checkpoint metrics, public class and feature names, ETG summaries, and non-sample reproducibility hashes; no raw or per-sample record is uploaded.",
